{"ticker":"SYK","updated":"2026-10-30T23:14:41Z","profile":{"longName":"Stryker Corporation","shortName":"Stryker Corporation","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Devices","country":"United States","website":"https://www.stryker.com","fullTimeEmployees":56000,"marketCap":111949627392,"trailingPE":30.244558,"forwardPE":17.761295,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.3329186,"pegRatio":1.46,"targetMeanPrice":362.6154,"targetHighPrice":465.0,"targetLowPrice":298.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":26,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.094,"earningsGrowth":0.441,"grossMargins":0.65588,"operatingMargins":0.27015,"profitMargins":0.14433,"totalRevenue":25837000704,"beta":0.781,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":389.33,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":267.0,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.13},"summary":"Stryker Corporation operates as a medical technology company in the United States and internationally. It operates through two segments, MedSurg and Neurotechnology, and Orthopaedics. The MedSurg and Neurotechnology segment offers surgical equipment, patient and caregiver safety technologies, navigation systems, endoscopic and communications systems, patient handling, emergency medical equipment and intensive care disposable products, clinical communication and artificial intelligence-assisted virtual care platform technology, and minimally invasive products for the treatment of acute ischemic and hemorrhagic stroke and venous thromboembolism; traditional brain and open skull based surgical procedures products; and orthobiologic and biosurgery products, including synthetic bone grafts and vertebral augmentation products. The Orthopaedics segment provides implants for use in total joint replacements, such as hip, knee and shoulder, ankle, and trauma and extremities surgeries; and Mako Shoulder, which expands the smart robotics suite of applications. The company sells its products to doctors, hospitals, and other healthcare facilities through company-owned subsidiaries and branches, as well as third-party dealers and distributors in approximately 61 countries. Stryker Corporation was founded in 1941 and is headquartered in Portage, Michigan.","summary_zh":"Stryker Corporation 作為一家醫療技術公司在美國和國際上運作。它透過兩個部門運作：醫療外科和神經技術部門以及骨科部門。 MedSurg 和神經技術部門提供手術設備、患者和護理人員安全技術、導航系統、內視鏡和通訊系統、病患處理、緊急醫療設備和重症監護一次性產品、臨床通訊和人工智慧輔助虛擬護理平台技術，以及用於治療急性缺血性和出血性中風和靜脈血栓栓塞的微創產品；傳統的腦部和開放式生物移植手術產品；骨科和骨外科手術產品；骨科和骨外科手術產品。骨科部門提供全關節置換的植入物，例如髖關節、膝關節、肩關節、踝關節以及創傷和四肢手術； Mako Shoulder 擴展了智慧機器人應用套件。該公司透過公司旗下的子公司和分支機構以及遍布約 61 個國家的第三方經銷商和分銷商向醫生、醫院和其他醫療機構銷售其產品。 Stryker Corporation 成立於 1941 年，總部位於密西根州波蒂奇。","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"醫療器材","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":388.92,"h":390.9,"l":386.01,"c":389.94,"v":1141000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":389.88,"h":391.4,"l":384.25,"c":388.56,"v":898000},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":389.12,"h":396.86,"l":386.81,"c":394.34,"v":1040200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":394.0,"h":396.37,"l":389.64,"c":392.31,"v":1094100},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":390.98,"h":393.53,"l":388.16,"c":393.11,"v":854500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":392.9,"h":395.9,"l":390.39,"c":392.76,"v":1024700},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":392.95,"h":392.95,"l":381.51,"c":382.97,"v":931700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":383.22,"h":389.37,"l":382.95,"c":388.79,"v":861300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":386.04,"h":387.8,"l":382.71,"c":383.34,"v":985300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":383.78,"h":386.52,"l":376.66,"c":377.11,"v":843000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":375.49,"h":378.59,"l":375.0,"c":376.62,"v":1251200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":376.6,"h":381.19,"l":374.77,"c":376.88,"v":949400},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":374.69,"h":378.15,"l":373.27,"c":377.84,"v":1531700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":379.08,"h":380.4,"l":376.31,"c":376.83,"v":1924300},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":375.65,"h":381.62,"l":374.12,"c":378.22,"v":2095300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":376.67,"h":378.69,"l":372.08,"c":373.52,"v":1865300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":372.81,"h":374.18,"l":369.4,"c":371.22,"v":1684700},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":367.9,"h":369.38,"l":362.0,"c":368.57,"v":1752400},{"t":"2025-09-26